OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested after woman's
OL,4,Abody discovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested following
OL,7,Fthe death of a woman in Leicestershire.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police said the body of
OL,10,Fa woman in her 40s was found at an
OL,11,Faddress in Barradale Avenue, Sileby, by
OL,12,FEast Midlands Ambulance Service on 16
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FThe force said the death was being
OL,16,Ftreated as unexplained, and following
OL,17,Ffurther inquiries, three men, 51, 31
OL,18,Fand 30, were arrested in connection
OL,19,Fwith the death on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
